  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5505.02 Availability of List to the Public. The division shall maintain the public list compiled pursuant to Saf-C 5505.01 on the internet at the following address:\n\nhttps://business.nh.gov/nsor/\n\nSource. #5537, eff 1-1-93; ss by #6314, EMERGENCY eff 8-9-96, EXPIRES: 12-7-96; ss by #6324, INTERIM eff 8-22-96, EXPIRES: 12-20-96; ss by #6358, eff 10-22-96; ss by #6919, INTERIM, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRES: 5-1-99; ss by #6990, EMERGENCY, eff 4-30-99, EXPIRES: 8-28-99; ss by #7066, eff 7-28-99; amd by #7649, eff 2-20-02; ss by #7982, INTERIM, eff 10-30-03, EXPIRED: 4-27-04\n\nNew. #8083, eff 5-11-04; ss by #10121, eff 4-25-12; ss by #13504, eff 12-9-22",
